          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra is perfectly happy with her single life and doesnâ€™t really want a relationship. And she definitely doesnâ€™t want the mess that comes with the inevitable end.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And yet... Glimmer is... something else.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inspired by "Future me hates me" By the Beths. &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/iVImwSb4EYU?si=LSIniBYQst7srLm2" rel="nofollow"&gt;Give it a listen!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For Bagge, because he's brilliant but also because I once complained to him that I wanted to write this but didnâ€™t know how. But now I have!&lt;br /&gt;And for Randomisedmongoose because theyâ€™re awesome.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
